  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto is consistently emphasizing the importance of expanding cooperation within the ASEAN framework. This regional strategy involves multiple sectors, ranging from mineral resource management to cybersecurity. Recently, state-owned mining company MIND ID initiated discussions to integrate mineral industrial processes between Indonesia and Malaysia. Simultaneously, the Ministry of Communication and Digital is advocating for the implementation of regional protocols designed to mitigate digital scams affecting ASEAN member states. These initiatives align with the administration's broader goal of fostering multilateral ties to ensure economic stability and technological security across Southeast Asia. Beyond ASEAN, the Indonesian government remains engaged in various bilateral economic and infrastructure projects, reflecting a comprehensive approach to maintaining regional influence and domestic development through collaborative frameworks with international and regional partners.",
